{"unit_id": "tag:07ZS:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是一个概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>是拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）分次（graded）<MATH_0003>-代数（algebra），由<MATH_0004>在<MATH_0005>上生成（generated）。进一步假设<MATH_0006>在<MATH_0007>上是有限型（finite type）的。令<MATH_0008>。在这种情形下，<MATH_0009>是射影（projective）的。具体而言，分次（graded）<MATH_0010>-代数映射（algebra map）<MATH_0011>所对应的态射（morphism）是闭浸入（closed immersion），见 Constructions 中的引理<REF_0001>。\n", "allowed_english": ["Constructions"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "generated", "target_term": "生成"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次"}, {"source_term": "algebra map", "target_term": "代数映射"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "指开头设定的对象。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚", "context": "描述所设分次代数的拟凝聚性质。"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次", "context": "分别修饰所设的代数和用来确定态射的代数映射。"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "指带有指定系数对象的代数。"}, {"source_term": "generated", "target_term": "生成", "context": "描述该代数在指定对象上的生成关系。"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型", "context": "描述一对象在另一对象上的有限型条件。"}, {"source_term": "projective", "target_term": "射影", "context": "指本例断言的射影性质。"}, {"source_term": "algebra map", "target_term": "代数映射", "context": "指给出相应态射的分次代数映射。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "指从给定代数映射得到的态射。"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入", "context": "指相应态射所属的类别。"}], "notes": []}
